; THE LANDING (the finish run, Act IV) — where the Sunspire library's story gate lets the player out.
;
; The one terrace at the realm's south-west edge that still holds a whole floor (region_spec_celestial
; LANDING, levelled flat), centred at cell-local (37, 58). The player arrives at local (37, 62)
; (RegionResource.SpawnPoint) facing north up the assault road; the code-built return portal stands
; behind them at local (37, 73) (PortalPoint). Two pillars of a fallen gatehouse frame the road out;
; a cold brazier and a broken wall say someone held this landing once. Nothing here fights.
